  "sourceTitle": "Banana Ice",
  "sourceText": "Banana Ice\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 15, 2009 - 1:26pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup Sugar\n1 cup Water\n1 Banana mashed\n3/4 cup Orange juice\n1/4 cup Pineapple juice\n2 tablespoons Lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Put sugar and water in glass bowl and microwave on high 3 to 4 minutes until boiling. Stir in remaining ingredients and pour into ice trays. 2 Freeze.",
